<title>HONG KONG: Kumagai sells office space to CITIC.</title>
<headline>Kumagai sells office space to CITIC.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kumagai Gumi (Hong Kong) Ltd said on Monday it had signed an agreement to sell nine floors of its 80-storey Sky Central Plaza in Guangzhou to China International Trust and Investment Corp group for HK$600 million.</p>
<p>The company said CITIC's acquisition comprised over 16,000 sq feet of retail space.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441  http://www.hk97.com</p>
